# Build context of docker/pi-sandbox/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore instead of the
# root .dockerignore). Only what that Dockerfile copies or bind-mounts: the pptx skill tree (fonts,
# requirements, the self-test), this directory, and the CA placeholder / an operator's CA file.
*
!default-skills/skills/pptx/
!docker/pi-sandbox/
!docker/extra-ca.crt.example
!docker/tls-fullchain.crt
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.build/
